editorconfig .editorconfig [build/_build.Tests/Fixtures/RepositoryGates/RepositoryFiles.cs] dotnet_diagnostic.MA0045.severity = none | # Tracked paths load lazily through synchronous properties, and gate predicates read repository text synchronously. # Winner: the repository-gate inventory contract; MA0045 remains enabled for every other file.
